  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Energisektor&#xf6;versikt Tanzania</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Joint Energy Sector Review - Joint Energy Sector Review NS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Energy sector Review. Joint exercise by donors and Ministry of Energy. Sweden finances the consultancy support.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Sektorsgenomg&#xe5;ng av energisektorn. Genomf&#xf6;rs av bist&#xe5;ndsgivare och energiministeriet. Sverige finansierar konsultst&#xf6;det.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Objectives with the intervention is to undertake an energy sector review in Tanzania. The review is done jointly by the Tanzanian government and development cooperation partners in Tanzania active in the energy sector. The review had the help from a procured consultancy that did interviews, data compilation and report writing.</narrative>
  </description>
